27
00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:51.240
Finish by asking the patient to look into the light to bring the centre of the macula

28
00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.890
called the fovea into view.

29
00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:56.520
In a non-dilator die this will cause the people to constrict

30
00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.175
